 1881: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 1882: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 1883: 
 1884: //    Inputs:
 1885: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 1886: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 1887: 
 1888: //    Outputs:
