 1890: //    @param nextElement: element that contains the intersection point
 1891: //    @param xIntersect, yIntersect: intersection point  
 1892: 
 1893: //    The equations for the two segments (the one we are considering and one of the sides of the element) are:
 1894: //    P1(tt1) = (x1,y1) + tt1*(x2-x1, y2-y1)  where 0 <= tt1 <= 1
 1895: //    P2(tt2) = (x3,y3) + tt2*(x4-x3, y4-y3)  where 0 <= tt2 <= 1
